      "type": "text",
      "text": "### 🚀 Project: Shopify Theme DNK-Ecom (L2 Project DNA)\n\n**Account**: `acct-dnk-maksym`\n**Project ID**: `proj-shopify-dnk-ecom`\n**Domain**: `shopify_theme`\n**Manifest**: `docs/projects/dnk_ecom/project.manifest.yaml`\n**Brand DNA**: `docs/projects/dnk_ecom/brand_dna.json`\n\n**Mission**:\nBuild an ultra-fast, modular, high-converting sovereign Shopify theme engine on Horizon Tinker 4.2.0 with Theme Blocks 2.0 and native CRO capabilities.",
